class=\"basic label-container\" style=\"\" x=\"-95.2109375\" y=\"-27\" width=\"190.421875\" height=\"54\"/><g class=\"label\" style=\"\" transform=\"translate(-65.2109375, -12)\"><rect/><foreignObject width=\"130.421875\" height=\"24\"><div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" style=\"display: table-cell; white-space: nowrap; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 200px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"nodeLabel\"><p>Use the HTTP API</p></span></div></foreignObject></g></g></g></g></g><defs><filter id=\"mermaid-0-drop-shadow\" height=\"130%\" width=\"130%\"><feDropShadow dx=\"4\" dy=\"4\" stdDeviation=\"0\" flood-opacity=\"0.06\" flood-color=\"#000000\"/></filter></defs><defs><filter id=\"mermaid-0-drop-shadow-small\" height=\"150%\" width=\"150%\"><feDropShadow dx=\"2\" dy=\"2\" stdDeviation=\"0\" flood-opacity=\"0.06\" flood-color=\"#000000\"/></filter></defs><linearGradient id=\"mermaid-0-gradient\" gradientUnits=\"objectBoundingBox\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"hsl(0, 0%, 83.3333333333%)\" stop-opacity=\"1\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"hsl(0, 0%, 88.9215686275%)\" stop-opacity=\"1\"/></linearGradient></svg>\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + The HTTP API calls the calculator service directly. The SDK calls the same\nweb test:native-pair: + service in-process. Keep tax logic in the shared calculator and rule packages.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Next steps [#next-steps]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + * Use [Plain SDK](/sdk/plain-sdk) for most server-side TypeScript apps.\nweb test:native-pair: + * Use [Effect SDK](/sdk/effect-sdk) for in-process Effect composition.\nweb test:native-pair: + * Use the API section when you need HTTP endpoint details.\nweb test:native-pair: + `,i={contents:[{heading:`choose-sdk-or-http-api`,content:`Choose the SDK when your application can import TypeScript packages. Choose the\nweb test:native-pair: + HTTP API when the calculation should run on the server or the caller cannot\nweb test:native-pair: + import TypeScript packages. The SDK's root, AU and schema entrypoints also\nweb test:native-pair: + support browser callers; those calculations run on the caller's device.`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Environment`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Choose`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Why`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Server-side TypeScript application`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Plain SDK`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`You get typed calculator inputs and reports without HTTP transport.`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`TypeScript application that wants typed failures`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Safe SDK`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:\"You get `TaxKit.safe.calculate` result values.\"},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Effect application`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Effect SDK`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:\"You can compose `calculateRunRequest`, `calculateReportRequest` and `calculateReport` with services and layers.\"},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Browser application`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`HTTP API or SDK`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`HTTP sends the request to the server; the browser-safe SDK calculates on the device.`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Non-TypeScript backend`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`HTTP API`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`You can use JSON and generated OpenAPI reference.`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Generated endpoint contract`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`HTTP API`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`OpenAPI owns endpoint shape and status codes.`},{heading:`recommended-paths`,content:`The HTTP API calls the calculator service directly. The SDK calls the same\nweb test:native-pair: + service in-process. Keep tax logic in the shared calculator and rule packages.`},{heading:`next-steps`,content:`Use Plain SDK for most server-side TypeScript apps.`},{heading:`next-steps`,content:`Use Effect SDK for in-process Effect composition.`},{heading:`next-steps`,content:`Use the API section when you need HTTP endpoint details.`}],headings:[{id:`choose-sdk-or-http-api`,content:`Choose SDK or HTTP API`},{id:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Choose by environment`},{id:`recommended-paths`,content:`Recommended paths`},{id:`next-steps`,content:`Next steps`}]},a=[{depth:1,url:`#choose-sdk-or-http-api`,title:(0,t.jsx)(t.Fragment,{children:`Choose SDK or HTTP API`})},{depth:2,url:`#choose-by-environment`,title:(0,t.jsx)(t.Fragment,{children:`Choose by environment`})},{depth:2,url:`#recommended-paths`,title:(0,t.jsx)(t.Fragment,{children:`Recommended paths`})},{depth:2,url:`#next-steps`,title:(0,t.jsx)(t.Fragment,{children:`Next steps`})}];function o(e){let n={a:`a`,circle:`circle`,code:`code`,defs:`defs`,div:`div`,feDropShadow:`feDropShadow`,filter:`filter`,foreignObject:`foreignObject`,g:`g`,h1:`h1`,h2:`h2`,li:`li`,linearGradient:`linearGradient`,marker:`marker`,p:`p`,path:`path`,polygon:`polygon`,rect:`rect`,span:`span`,stop:`stop`,style:`style`,svg:`svg`,table:`table`,tbody:`tbody`,td:`td`,th:`th`,thead:`thead`,tr:`tr`,ul:`ul`,...e.components};return(0,t.jsxs)(t.Fragment,{children:[(0,t.jsx)(n.h1,{id:`choose-sdk-or-http-api`,children:`Choose SDK or HTTP API`}),`\nweb test:native-pair: + `,(0,t.jsx)(n.p,{children:`Choose the SDK when your application can import TypeScript packages. Choose the\nweb test:native-pair: + HTTP API when the calculation should run on the server or the caller cannot\nweb test:native-pair: + import TypeScript packages. The SDK's root, AU and schema entrypoints also\nweb test:native-pair: + support browser callers; those calculations run on the caller's device.`}),`\nweb test:native-pair: + `,(0,t.jsx)(n.h2,{id:`choose-by-environment`,children:`Choose by