: + import { Cents, aud } from \"@taxkit/core/primitives\";\nweb test:native-pair: + import { au } from \"@taxkit/sdk/au\";\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + const report = await au.incomeTax.annual({\nweb test:native-pair: +   taxableIncome: aud(Cents.make(9_000_000)),\nweb test:native-pair: + });\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + console.log(report._tag);\nweb test:native-pair: + console.log(report.liability.cents);\nweb test:native-pair: + console.log(report.ledger.components.length);\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Expected output includes:\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`txt\nweb test:native-pair: + AnnualTaxReport\nweb test:native-pair: + 1958800\nweb test:native-pair: + 3\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + This is the retained 2025–26 fixture. The\nweb test:native-pair: + [annual calculation guide](/guides/calculate-annual-income-tax) explains\nweb test:native-pair: + the pending Medicare threshold review; this output does not establish\nweb test:native-pair: + current-law accuracy.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Ledgers [#ledgers]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Ledgers break a calculation into components such as income tax, offsets and\nweb test:native-pair: + Medicare levy. Components preserve trace information so a reviewer can inspect\nweb test:native-pair: + how a total was assembled.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Related concepts [#related-concepts]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + * [Diagnostics](/concepts/diagnostics)\nweb test:native-pair: + * [Graph, trace and ledgers architecture](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/a151e51e8a30247526fa93412df046955846eca4/docs/architecture/graph-trace-ledgers.md)\nweb test:native-pair: + * [Calculate annual income tax](/guides/calculate-annual-income-tax)\nweb test:nativ