se`,content:`The calculator-specific report union. SDK helpers narrow this through the descriptor output schema.`},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:\"`CalculatorServiceError` is the expected calculator service failure union.\"},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:`Error`},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:`When you see it`},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:\"`CalculatorInputDecodeError`\"},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:`Request facts do not match the selected calculator input schema.`},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:\"`UnsupportedCalculatorError`\"},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:`The requested calculator id is not in the public catalogue.`},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:\"`UnsupportedCalculatorContextError`\"},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:`The calculator exists, but not for the requested jurisdiction or tax year.`},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:\"`CalculationError`\"},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:`The calculation engine returned a source-backed domain failure.`},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:\"`CalculatorCapacityExceeded`\"},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:`The server has no free calculation place. Retry manually after the current work finishes.`},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:\"`CalculatorOperationTimedOut`\"},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:`The operation reached its time limit. Retry manually.`},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:\"`CalculatorRateLimited`\"},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:\"The native per-client calculation limit was reached. Wait for `Retry-After` and retry manually.\"},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:\"`CalculatorAdmissionUnavailable`\"},{heading:`calculatorserviceerror`,content:`The native request identity or rate limiter is unavailable. Retry manually.`},{heading:`owning-sources`,content:\"Calculator schemas: `packages/calculators/src/schemas.ts`\"},{headin