es pending\nweb test:native-pair: + Changesets.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`ts\nweb test:native-pair: + Production: release metadata\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + package-facing change\nweb test:native-pair: +   -> Changeset\nweb test:native-pair: +     -> bun run changeset status --verbose\nweb test:native-pair: +     -> bun run version-repo during release prep\nweb test:native-pair: +     -> package changelogs and versions\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## When to add a Changeset [#when-to-add-a-changeset]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Add a Changeset when you change package-facing behaviour:\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + * package exports\nweb test:native-pair: + * package README behaviour or commands\nweb test:native-pair: + * public SDK helper shape\nweb test:native-pair: + * HTTP API request, response or status shape\nweb test:native-pair: + * calculator schemas, errors, rule behaviour or package metadata\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Record a no-Changeset rationale when the change is docs-only, app-internal or\nweb test:native-pair: + execution-plan-only.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Commands [#commands]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`sh\nweb test:native-pair: + bun run changeset\nweb test:native-pair: + bun run changeset status --verbose\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Run \\`bun run version-repo\\` only when you intend to apply pending release-train\nweb test:native-pair: + versions and changelogs.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Related pages [#related-pages]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + * [Changelog](/reference/changelog)\nweb test:native-pair: + * [Release notes](/reference/release-notes)\nweb test:native-pair: + * [Backward compatibility](/contributing/backward-compatibility)\nweb test:native-pair: + * [Changesets](/contributing/changesets)\nweb test:native-pair: + `,i={contents:[{heading:`versioning`,content:`Use this page when you need to decide whether a docs, SDK, API or rule change\nweb test:native-pair: + needs release metadata.`},{heading:`release-train`,content:`TaxKit uses a fixed release-train workflow for implemented packages. Package\nweb test:native-pair: + versions should move together when \\`bun run version-repo\\` applies pending\nweb test:native-pair: + Changesets.`},{heading:`when-to-add-a-changeset`,content:`Add a Changeset when you change package-facing behaviour:`},{heading:`when-to-add-a-changeset`,content:`package exports`},{heading:`when-to-add-a-changeset`,content:`package README behaviour or commands`},{heading:`when-to-add-a-changeset`,content:`public SDK helper shape`},{heading:`when-to-add-a-changeset`,content:`HTTP API request, response or status shape`},{heading:`when-to-add-a-changeset`,content:`calculator schemas, errors, rule behaviour or package metadata`},{heading:`when-to-add-a-changeset`,content:`Record a no-Changeset rationale when the change is docs-only, app-internal or\nweb test:native-pair: + execution-plan-only.`},{heading:`commands`,content:\"Run `bun run version-repo` only when you intend to apply pending release-train\\nversions and changelogs.\"},{heading:`related-pages`,content:`Changelog`},{heading:`related-pages`,content:`Release notes`},{heading:`related-pages`,content:`Backward compatibility`},{heading:`related-pages`,content:`Changesets`}],headings:[{id:`versioning`,content:`Versioning`},{id:`release-train`,content:`Release train`},{id:`when-to-add-a-changeset`,content:`When to add a Changeset`},{id:`commands`,content:`Commands`},{id:`related-pages`,content:`Related pages`}]},a=[{depth:1,url:`#versioning`,title:(0,t.jsx)(t.Fragment,{children:`Versioning`})},{depth:2,url:`#release-train`,title:(0,t.jsx)(t.Fragment,{children:`Release train`})},{depth:2,url