 test:native-pair: + * package README behaviour\nweb test:native-pair: + * rule package behaviour that affects published calculation output\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Run:\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`sh\nweb test:native-pair: + bun run changeset\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Then check the pending release state:\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`sh\nweb test:native-pair: + bun run changeset status --verbose\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Do not run \\`bun run version-repo\\` unless you are intentionally applying the\nweb test:native-pair: + pending release train.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## When a Changeset is not required [#when-a-changeset-is-not-required]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Docs-only changes inside \\`packages/docs-content/content\\`, navigation updates and active\nweb test:native-pair: + exec-plan validation notes do not need a Changeset when they do not change\nweb test:native-pair: + package exports, package README behaviour or runtime behaviour.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + State the no-Changeset rationale in your PR and handoff.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## PR evidence [#pr-evidence]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Link the Changeset path or write the no-Changeset rationale in\nweb test:native-pair: + [PR evidence checklist](/contributing/pr-evidence-checklist).\nweb test:native-pair: + `,i={contents:[{heading:`changesets`,content:`Use this page when your contribution changes package-facing behaviour,\nweb test:native-pair: + exports, public schemas, package READMEs or runtime contracts.`},{heading:`when-you-need-a-changeset`,content:`Add or update a Changeset when you change:`},{heading:`when-you-need-a-changeset`,content:`public package exports`},{heading