 Next steps [#next-steps]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + * Use [Plain SDK](/sdk/plain-sdk) for most server-side TypeScript apps.\nweb test:native-pair: + * Use [Effect SDK](/sdk/effect-sdk) for in-process Effect composition.\nweb test:native-pair: + * Use the API section when you need HTTP endpoint details.\nweb test:native-pair: + `,i={contents:[{heading:`choose-sdk-or-http-api`,content:`Choose the SDK when your application can import TypeScript packages. Choose the\nweb test:native-pair: + HTTP API when the calculation should run on the server or the caller cannot\nweb test:native-pair: + import TypeScript packages. The SDK's root, AU and schema entrypoints also\nweb test:native-pair: + support browser callers; those calculations run on the caller's device.`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Environment`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Choose`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Why`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Server-side TypeScript application`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Plain SDK`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`You get typed calculator inputs and reports without HTTP transport.`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`TypeScript application that wants typed failures`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Safe SDK`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:\"You get `TaxKit.safe.calculate` result values.\"},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Effect application`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Effect SDK`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:\"You can compose `calculateRunRequest`, `calculateReportRequest` and `calculateReport` with services and layers.\"},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`Browser application`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`HTTP API or SDK`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content:`HTTP sends the request to the server; the browser-safe SDK calculates on the device.`},{heading:`choose-by-environment`,content: