 from the\nweb test:native-pair: + repository changelog and applied package changelogs.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Source order [#source-order]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Use sources in this order:\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + 1. Applied package changelogs after \\`bun run version-repo\\`.\nweb test:native-pair: + 2. The repository [\\`CHANGELOG.md\\`](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/a151e51e8a30247526fa93412df046955846eca4/CHANGELOG.md).\nweb test:native-pair: + 3. Pending \\`.changeset/*.md\\` files only before a release is applied.\nweb test:native-pair: + 4. Public docs pages when the release changes SDK, API or contribution\nweb test:native-pair: +    behaviour.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Describe local changes as unreleased until you have a receipt for the exact\nweb test:native-pair: + published package or deployed API. Package manifests, source exports and local\nweb test:native-pair: + checks establish implementation; they do not establish public availability.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Release note shape [#release-note-shape]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`md\nweb test:native-pair: + # Version 1.0.0 (unpublished)\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Changed\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + - Changed package names to \\`@taxkit/*\\`.\nweb test:native-pair: + - Changed runtime configuration names to the \\`TAXKIT_\\` prefix.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Migration notes\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Update package imports and runtime configuration names. Packages remain\nweb test:native-pair: + private and unpublished.\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Review checklist [#review-checklist]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + * Name the affected public SDK, API, calculator or package surface.\nweb test:native-pair: + * Explain required migration steps, if any.\nweb test:native-pair: + * Link to the owning guide or reference page.\nweb test:native-pair: + * Avoid downstream application details.\nweb test:native-pair: + * Confirm \\`bun run changeset status --verbose\\` before handoff.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Related pages [#related-pages]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + * [Changelog](/reference/changelog)\nweb test:native-pair: + * [Versioning](/reference/versioning)\nweb test:native-pair: + * [PR evidence checklist](/contributing/pr-evidence-checklist)\nweb test:native-pair: + `,i={contents:[{heading:`release-notes`,content:`Use this page when you need to prepare reader-facing release notes from the\nweb test:native-pair: + repository changelog and applied package changelogs.`},{heading:`source-order`,content:`Use sources in this order:`},{heading:`source-order`,content:\"Applied package changelogs after `bun run version-repo`.\"},{heading:`source-order`,content:\"The repository `CHANGELOG.md`.\"},{heading:`source-order`,content:\"Pending `.changeset/*.md` files only before a release is applied.\"},{heading:`source-order`,content:`Public docs pages when the release changes SDK, API or contribution\nweb test:native-pair: + behaviour.`},{heading:`source-order`,content:`Describe local changes as unreleased until you have a receipt for the exact\nweb test:native-pair: + published package or deployed API. Package manifests, source exports and local\nweb test:native-pair: + checks establish implementation; they do not establish public availability.`},{heading:`review-checklist`,content:`Name the affected public SDK, API, calculator or package surface.`},{heading:`review-checklist`,content:`Explain required migration steps, if any.`},{heading:`review-checklist`,content:`Link to the owning guide or reference page.`},{heading:`review-checklist`,content:`Avoid downstream application details