typed result bags.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## When this matters [#when-this-matters]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Read the report when your application needs final amounts, ledger components\nweb test:native-pair: + or trace-linked explanation. Keep assertions focused on fields your\nweb test:native-pair: + application uses.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## How it works [#how-it-works]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`ts\nweb test:native-pair: + import { Cents, aud } from \"@taxkit/core/primitives\";\nweb test:native-pair: + import { au } from \"@taxkit/sdk/au\";\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + const report = await au.incomeTax.annual({\nweb test:native-pair: +   taxableIncome: aud(Cents.make(9_000_000)),\nweb test:native-pair: + });\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + console.log(report._tag);\nweb test:native-pair: + console.log(report.liability.cents);\nweb test:native-pair: + console.log(report.ledger.components.length);\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Expected output includes:\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`txt\nweb test:native-pair: + AnnualTaxReport\nweb test:native-pair: + 1958800\nweb test:native-pair: + 3\nweb test:native-pair: + \\`\\`\\`\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + This is the retained 2025–26 fixture. The\nweb test:native-pair: + [annual calculation guide](/guides/calculate-annual-income-tax) explains\nweb test:native-pair: + the pending Medicare threshold review; this output does not establish\nweb test:native-pair: + current-law accuracy.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Ledgers [#ledgers]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + Ledgers break a calculation into components such as income tax, offsets and\nweb test:native-pair: + Medicare levy. Components preserve trace information so a reviewer can inspect\nweb test:native-pair: + how a total was assembled.\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + ## Related concepts [#related-concepts]\nweb test:native-pair: +\nweb test:native-pair: + * [Diagnostics](/concepts/diagnostics)\nweb test:native-pair: + * [Graph, trace and ledgers architecture](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/a151e51e8a30247526fa93412df046955846eca4/docs/architecture/graph-trace-ledgers.md)\nweb test:native-pair: + * [Calculate annual income tax](/guides/calculate-annual-income-tax)\nweb test:native-pair: + `,i={contents:[{heading:`reports`,content:`A report is the calculator-specific output returned by the SDK or HTTP API.\nweb test:native-pair: + Reports are schema-backed values, not untyped result bags.`},{heading:`when-this-matters`,content:`Read the report when your application needs final amounts, ledger components\nweb test:native-pair: + or trace-linked explanation. Keep assertions focused on fields your\nweb test:native-pair: + application uses.`},{heading:`how-it-works`,content:`Expected output includes:`},{heading:`how-it-works`,content:`This is the retained 2025–26 fixture. The\nweb test:native-pair: + annual calculation guide explains\nweb test:native-pair: + the pending Medicare threshold review; this output does not establish\nweb test:native-pair: + current-law accuracy.`},{heading:`ledgers`,content:`Ledgers break a calculation into components such as income tax, offsets and\nweb test:native-pair: + Medicare levy. Components preserve trace information so a reviewer can inspect\nweb test:native-pair: + how a total was assembled.`},{heading:`related-concepts`,content:`Diagnostics`},{heading:`related-concepts`,content:`Graph, trace and ledgers architecture`},{heading:`related-concepts`,content:`Calculate annual income tax`}],headings:[{id:`reports`,content:`Reports`},{id:`when-this-matters`,content:`When this matters`},{id:`how-it-works`,content:`How it works`},{id:`ledgers`,content:`Ledgers`},{id:`related-concepts`,c