nt` as a private compiled owner before the\\n3789:acceptance record, transport or replacement route. T005 stays in progress;\\n3797:The next T005 source pass corrects old Effect service/catch names, a stale\\n3818:Continue T005 with an independent native MDX index generated by the selected\\n3849:T005 remains in progress; source review/acceptance, link presentation, HTTP,\\n3881:No acceptance is inferred from that review probe. T005 and the full goal remain\\n3916:Website/API routes, discovery and images remain unfinished T005 work. The\\n3923:The next T005 slice moves page-link presentation into the existing MDX compiler.\\n3978:old-app retirement remain T005 work. This slice establishes neither deployment\\n3983:The next T005 slice records a named review decision for each of the 61 authored\\n3989:T005 implementation authority; the receipt does not claim that Cooper personally\\n4024:retirement remain unfinished; T005 stays in progress and metrics stay deferred.\\n4026:### T005 checked public-content HTTP candidate — 6 October\\n4060:connection/routes, discovery/images and old-app retirement remain T005 work.\\n4063:### T005 native documentation connection candidate — 7 October\\n4066:continue the agreed Q9 Website connection with four named native documentation\\n4099:### T005 Website documentation composition candidate — 7 October\\nzsh:1: no matches found: docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation/*\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791301886.358882}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
