41},"formatted_output":"docs/architecture/package-ownership.md:199:  routes use processed generated content through the service and client\ndocs/architecture/package-ownership.md:201:  The independent native MDX index and `./catalogue-source` Layer belong only\ndocs/architecture/package-ownership.md:211:  Those dependencies stay outside docs-content so HTTP can consume content\ndocs/architecture/package-ownership.md:213:  content, service runtime or publication entrypoint. Its standard compiler\ndocs/architecture/package-ownership.md:218:  owns Effect Schema to Standard Schema bridging, shared MDX compile config,\ndocs/architecture/package-ownership.md:221:  browser-safe MDX render primitives. It must not own TaxKit-specific\ndocs/architecture/package-ownership.md:222:  frontmatter, navigation, validation policy, routes or generated content.\ndocs/architecture/package-ownership.md:251:- Keep app-specific MDX components in `apps/docs`; promote only generic,\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:47:configuration owners. Its native package tests cover settings, safe error\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:60:`@taxkit/docs-content` and `@taxkit/docs-fumadocs` production entries,\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:90:`@taxkit/docs-content#generate` names content, navigation, source config,\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:92:the compiled `@taxkit/docs-fumadocs` build. The content build executes that\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:107:bun run --filter=@taxkit/docs-content test\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:110:Run those package-local docs gates whenever MDX content, Fumadocs source\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:118:permission, with a neighbouring rejection fixture and an exact-selector test. The package content test composes\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:120:`FumadocsSource` test Layer and covers accepted, missing and malformed content.\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:180:content and HTTP