the\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:1358:unfinished. Timers cannot force synchronous CPU pre-emption or remote Worker\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:1400:owns qualification; public request absence and rate work remain unfinished.\ndocs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md:1449:retirement, deployment or public availability. Those remain T005 work.\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:5:owner: taxkit-content-owner\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:7:review_trigger: content ownership, acceptance or generated presentation changes\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:12:TaxKit public content should explain the open-source engine, supported rule\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:17:This doc owns public docs/content direction for TaxKit. It should stay focused\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:24:  shell, app-specific MDX component composition and browser rendering.\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:26:`packages/docs-content/content`\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:27:: Public MDX content root. It owns the Start, SDK, API, Guides, Concepts,\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:30:`packages/docs-content/navigation.json`\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:33:  decoded and enforced beside the package-owned content and examples.\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:35:`packages/content`\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:43:`packages/docs-content`\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:44:: Private source-only package for authored navigation, meta, MDX, validation\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:46:  page/navigation/source-error exports re-export `@taxkit/content` contracts;\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:48:  Its independent native MDX index and build-only source Layer use the installed\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:57:  depends on HTTP/SDK/calculator contracts independently of the content package,\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:58:  preventing a cycle when the backend consumes content contracts. Public MDX\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:59:  references these retained templates; content validation checks those links.\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:64:  and generic MDX render primitives.\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:67:: Machine-readable separation between public content, maintainer documents,\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:74:version-two records and exact source hashes before and after MDX processing,\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:79:prevent a later edit from silently inheriting acceptance. The docs-content\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:85:refinement and fixed missing-page/search errors serve both transports. Replacement Website routes and discovery remain T005 work.\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:103:        -> packages/docs-content/.source/server\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:104:          -> packages/docs-content/content/**/*.mdx\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:105:      -> packages/docs-content/navigation.json\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:106:    -> @taxkit/docs-content/client\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:107:      -> Fumadocs compiled MDX module\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:109:    -> app-local MDX component map\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:116:  -> @taxkit/docs-content validate\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:119:    -> MDX component allowlist\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:138:- Keep public MDX pages task-first. Use architecture docs for durable\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:140:- Validate public MDX through `@taxkit/docs-content`, which owns Effect Schema\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:141:  frontmatter, navigation coverage, source-text policy, local link, MDX\ndocs/architecture/content-and-posts.md:150:  content contracts in `@taxkit/docs-content`; keep route composition and\ndocs/architecture/frontend.md:24:: Native Website candidate with checked settings,