t each mismatch. A genuine server-function response is damaged in the browser to prove restoration rejects it. The API artifact must positively contain the executable calculator service identity and browser chunks must omit it; accepted documentation prose cannot stand in for an engine marker. Full-page images supplement functional observations only.'\nj['evidence'].append(receipt)\np.write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json');x=json.loads(p.read_text());x['last_reviewed']='2026-10-07';t=next(t for t in x['tasks'] if t['id']=='CSF-T005');t['evidence'].append(receipt);p.write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md');s=p.read_text();idx=s.index('### T005 Website documentation composition candidate — 7 October');s=s[:idx]+'''### T005 Website documentation composition candidate — 7 October\n\nContinue from qualified connection commit\n`049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e`. Its exact hosted Quality run\n`37481631010` completed successfully on 6 October at 15:10:07 UTC. That is parent\ncommit proof, not qualification of this new slice.\n\nThe Website now composes four named documentation operations over its native\nprivate connection. Its materialised native Request preserves the JSON byte\nbody and binding receiver; calculator rate-key composition stays separate.\nThe app has one server runtime and uses only browser-safe compiled presentation\nand checked contracts in browser modules. No authored-source fallback exists.\n\nThe catch-all route renders all 61 accepted pages. A dedicated route boundary\nrestores checked results before visible route-owned sidebar/article composition.\nCompiled Markdown and frontmatter must match the API page at preload and display.\nMissing pages keep native HTTP 404; expected failures provide fixed recovery UI.\nCanonical links use the checked Website origin; explicit Markdown links use the\nexisting API endpoint. Native browser page GET takes no data or client Context,\nonly a bounded public page header. SSR uses the original pathname. Exact\ngenerated function identities, query/content-type/method/path admission and\nsafe not-found handling are owned at native ingress.\n\nThe actual native pair passes eleven cases across seven files. It checks every\npage's real HTML, hostile SSR headers, native GET, three cold source-built\ncontent mismatches, damaged genuine browser transport, internal navigation\nwithout document reload, unique current-page semantics, heading focus without\nhydration stealing, phone navigation/table keyboard focus and reading without\nJavaScript. Images are supplemental reading-review evidence. Whole repository\nqualification and fresh independent reading review are pending in this candidate.\n\nThe mismatch test first exposed a stream tied to an earlier Cloudflare request\nin the generic Fetcher adapter. The native Request byte body fixes that actual\ncold-request failure. A browser bundle test also initially mistook a service\nname in accepted documentation prose for executable engine code; it now requires\nthe positively observed API service identity and excludes that identity from\nbrowser output. The receipt retains failed attempts and the owning corrections.\n\nDocumentation impact: **Change required** for Website/client composition,\nchecked native loader admission, route/MDX/focus/table ownership, build inputs,\nexact lint profiles and actual fixtures, affected app/content/RPC READMEs,\nfrontend/API/content/package/testing architecture, native journey, SPEC/tasks,\nthis plan and bounded evidence. **Preserve** all accepted page/navigation/review\nand template bytes, calculator contracts and retained results, historical docs\noperations, disabled collection and metrics deferral. **N/A** for new runbook\ncommands or provider/release/credential operations: existing native checks are\nextended; no deployment procedure changes. **N/A** for a new Changeset: only\nprivate app consumers and tests change, with no package export/wire change;\nthe earlier native documentation contract Changeset is preserved.\n\nSearch UI, crawler/discovery files, Markdown negotiation, share images and\nold-app retirement remain unfinished T005 work. No local check establishes\npublic availability, publication, deployment or safe exported telemetry.\n''';p.write_text(s)\nold=json.loads(Path('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-docs-connection.json').read_text())\nr={\n 'schemaVersion':1,'documentType':'bounded-proof-receipt','lifecycle':'evidence','authority':'supporting','owner':'taxkit-web-app-owner','observedAt':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'status':'Candidate local Website page connection; complete qualification and fresh reading review pending','baseHead':'049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e',\n 'actorAuthority':{'principal':'Cooper','reviewer':'Codex','operation':'Approved CSF-T005 implementation, local checks, commits, pushes and continuation of draft PR 155','environment':'Built local workerd/Chromium API and Website pair','approvalBoundary':'No merge, publication, deployment or provider apply'},\n 'outcome':['The Website composes four named documentation operations over its private binding and renders 61 accepted pages through browser-safe compiled presentation.','The materialised native HTTP request preserves JSON byte bodies, binding receiver and signal; returned native Responses are immediately checked and provider diagnostics discarded.','The data-free native page GET carries only a bounded checked public header; original SSR pathnames determine page identity. Only generated settings/page URLs are admitted.','Dedicated route restoration precedes route-owned result matching and sidebar/article composition. Native missing pages return HTML 404; expected failures have fixed recoverable guidance.','Compiled Markdown and frontmatter must match the checked API page at preload and display. Three controlled cold native mismatches fail safely.','Internal links retain router navigation, deliberate heading focus, a unique current-page marker, phone disclosure, keyboard table scrolling and ordinary no-JavaScript reading.'],\n 'impact':{'changeRequired':['Website app/client/config/native-loader/route/presentation/build ownership','Exact lint selectors and actual command fixtures','Website/content/RPC READMEs, frontend/API/content/package/testing architecture','SPEC/task/active-plan pointers, existing native critical journey and this receipt'],'preserve':['61 accepted authored pages, navigation, 64 historical review records, 62 active bindings and four integration templates','Calculator contract and retained tax outputs; Medicare decision remains unresolved','Historical docs app/procedures and immutable receipts','Disabled collection and explicit metrics deferral'],'notApplicable':['No new runbook command or deployment/recovery operation: existing local native procedure is extended','No new Changeset: private app consumers/tests only; existing package contract Changeset retained','No provider/credentials/registry/publication/CI workflow change']},\n 'priorFailureAndRecovery':['Actual cold mismatch SSR first failed through a request body stream associated with an earlier Cloudflare request. The generic installed Fetcher adapter creates that stream; installed Effect HttpClientRequest.toWeb preserves the original bytes. The app now uses that native conversion and attached binding fetch. Fresh native mismatches return safe HTML and checked errors. No dependency upgrade or alternate RPC protocol was introduced.','A naive browser-code canary matched PublicCalculatorService.calculate in accepted public documentation prose. The test now positively requires @taxkit/calculators/PublicCalculatorService in the actual API bundle and excludes that executable Context identity from browser output.','TanStack parent-route link activation produced more than one current-page marker; exact link matching restores unique page semantics.','Earlier test locators used a guessed SDK address and an absent authored link. They now select the actual accepted /sdk/typescript-sdk and Plain SDK destinations; no source content was changed.','The first diagram desktop screenshot retained mobile table-focus scroll position. All four supplemental captures now explicitly start at document top.'],\n 'focusedChecks':[json.loads(l) for l in Path('/private/tmp/dev76-website-docs-native-l-results.jsonl').read_text().splitlines()],\n 'fullQualification':{'status':'Pending'},'catalogueIdentity':old['catalogueIdentity'],'preservedSources':old['preservedSources'],'environment':old['environment'],\n 'limitations':['Search interaction, discovery files, Markdown negotiation, share images and retirement of the old documentation app remain unfinished T005 work.','Local built proof establishes no deployed/publicly available page, publication or external consumer.','Metrics remain deferred; disabled collection is retained and safe exported tracing is unfinished.','Controlled failure claims are bounded to the named local tests; no upstream cancellation or all-framework-error-path claim.'],\n 'rollback':'Restore qualified parent 049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e while preserving accepted sources and prior receipts.','task':'CSF-T005 / DEV-76'\n}\nPath(receipt).write_text(json.dumps(r,indent=2)+'\\n')\nPY"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json,datetime\nreceipt='docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-website-docs-connection.json'\np=Path('docs/verification/critical-journeys.json');x=json.loads(p.read_text());j=next(j for j in x['journeys'] if j['id']=='taxkit-native-website')\nj['actorOrConsumer']='Calculator Website visitor and documentation reader'\nj['inputs'].append('Accepted 61-page documentation catalogue and matching compiled MDX presentation')\nj['expectedBehavior'].extend([\n 'All 61 accepted pages return real SSR articles with matching headings, navigation, title, description, canonical and checked Markdown link; missing public pages return native HTML 404.',\n 'Native data-free documentation GET accepts only bounded public page headers; original SSR addresses cannot be overridden by headers. Invalid query/content-type/page inputs reject before framework parsing.',\n 'Cold body/metadata/module mismatch and damaged native browser transport show safe recoverable guidance. Internal sidebar/authored links use native GET without document reload, with one current-page marker and deliberate heading focus; hydration preserves initial focus.',\n 'Mobile navigation and table scrolling work with the keyboard, horizontal content stays inside the article and ordinary documentation links work without JavaScript.'\n])\nj['oracle']+=' Documentation assertions inspect actual initial HTML for every page before independent Chromium navigation. Three source-built API variants retain valid checked pages but change Markdown, metadata or module identity; cold Website SSR and the actual native GET must detect each mismatch. A genuine server-function response is damaged in the browser to prove restoration rejects it. The API artifact must positively contain the executable calculator service identity and browser chunks must omit it; accepted documentation prose cannot stand in for an engine marker. Full-page images supplement functional observations only.'\nj['evidence'].append(receipt)\np.write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json');x=json.loads(p.read_text());x['last_reviewed']='2026-10-07';t=next(t for t in x['tasks'] if t['id']=='CSF-T005');t['evidence'].append(receipt);p.write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\\n')\np=Path('docs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md');s=p.read_text();idx=s.index('### T005 Website documentation composition candidate — 7 October');s=s[:idx]+'''### T005 Website documentation composition candidate — 7 October\n\nContinue from qualified connection commit\n`049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e`. Its exact hosted Quality run\n`37481631010` completed successfully on 6 October at 15:10:07 UTC. That is parent\ncommit proof, not qualification of this new slice.\n\nThe Website now composes four named documentation operations over its native\nprivate connection. Its materialised native Request preserves the JSON byte\nbody and binding receiver; calculator rate-key composition stays separate.\nThe app has one server runtime and uses only browser-safe compiled presentation\nand checked contracts in browser modules. No authored-source fallback exists.\n\nThe catch-all route renders all 61 accepted pages. A dedicated route boundary\nrestores checked results before visible route-owned sidebar/article composition.\nCompiled Markdown and frontmatter must match the API page at preload and display.\nMissing pages keep native HTTP 404; expected failures provide fixed recovery UI.\nCanonical links use the checked Website origin; explicit Markdown links use the\nexisting API endpoint. Native browser page GET takes no data or client Context,\nonly a bounded public page header. SSR uses the original pathname. Exact\ngenerated function identities, query/content-type/method/path admission and\nsafe not-found handling are owned at native ingress.\n\nThe actual native pair passes eleven cases across seven files. It checks every\npage's real HTML, hostile SSR headers, native GET, three cold source-built\ncontent mismatches, damaged genuine browser transport, internal navigation\nwithout document reload, unique current-page semantics, heading focus without\nhydration stealing, phone navigation/table keyboard focus and reading without\nJavaScript. Images are supplemental reading-review evidence. Whole repository\nqualification and fresh independent reading review are pending in this candidate.\n\nThe mismatch test first exposed a stream tied to an earlier Cloudflare request\nin the generic Fetcher adapter. The native Request byte body fixes that actual\ncold-request failure. A browser bundle test also initially mistook a service\nname in accepted documentation prose for executable engine code; it now requires\nthe positively observed API service identity and excludes that identity from\nbrowser output. The receipt retains failed attempts and the owning corrections.\n\nDocumentation impact: **Change required** for Website/client composition,\nchecked native loader admission, route/MDX/focus/table ownership, build inputs,\nexact lint profiles and actual fixtures, affected app/content/RPC READMEs,\nfrontend/API/content/package/testing architecture, native journey, SPEC/tasks,\nthis plan and bounded evidence. **Preserve** all accepted page/navigation/review\nand template bytes, calculator contracts and retained results, historical docs\noperations, disabled collection and metrics deferral. **N/A** for new runbook\ncommands or provider/release/credential operations: existing native checks are\nextended; no deployment procedure changes. **N/A** for a new Changeset: only\nprivate app consumers and tests change, with no package export/wire change;\nthe earlier native documentation contract Changeset is preserved.\n\nSearch UI, crawler/discovery files, Markdown negotiation, share images and\nold-app retirement remain unfinished T005 work. No local check establishes\npublic availability, publication, deployment or safe exported telemetry.\n''';p.write_text(s)\nold=json.loads(Path('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-docs-connection.json').read_text())\nr={\n 'schemaVersion':1,'documentType':'bounded-proof-receipt','lifecycle':'evidence','authority':'supporting','owner':'taxkit-web-app-owner','observedAt':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'status':'Candidate local Website page connection; complete qualification and fresh reading review pending','baseHead':'049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e',\n 'actorAuthority':{'principal':'Cooper','reviewer':'Codex','operation':'Approved CSF-T005 implementation, local checks, commits, pushes and continuation of draft PR 155','environment':'Built local workerd/Chromium API and Website pair','approvalBoundary':'No merge, publication, deployment or provider apply'},\n 'outcome':['The Website composes four named documentation operations over its private binding and renders 61 accepted pages through browser-safe compiled presentation.','The materialised native HTTP request preserves JSON byte bodies, binding receiver and signal; returned native Responses are immediately checked and provider diagnostics discarded.','The data-free native page GET carries only a bounded checked public header; original SSR pathnames determine page identity. Only generated settings/page URLs are admitted.','Dedicated route restoration precedes route-owned result matching and sidebar/article composition. Native missing pages return HTML 404; expected failures have fixed recoverable guidance.','Compiled Markdown and frontmatter must match the checked API page at preload and display. Three controlled cold native mismatches fail safely.','Internal links retain router navigation, deliberate heading focus, a unique current-page marker, phone disclosure, keyboard table scrolling and ordinary no-JavaScript reading.'],\n 'impact':{'changeRequired':['Website app/client/config/native-loader/route/presentation/build ownership','Exact lint selectors and actual command fixtures','Website/content/RPC READMEs, frontend/API/content/package/testing architecture','SPEC/task/active-plan pointers, existing native critical journey and this receipt'],'preserve':['61 accepted authored pages, navigation, 64 historical review records, 62 active bindings and four integration templates','Calculator contract and retained tax outputs; Medicare decision remains unresolved','Historical docs app/procedures and immutable receipts','Disabled collection and explicit metrics deferral'],'notApplicable':['No new runbook command or deployment/recovery operation: existing local native procedure is extended','No new Changeset: private app consumers/tests only; existing package contract Changeset retained','No provider/credentials/registry/publication/CI workflow change']},\n 'priorFailureAndRecovery':['Actual cold mismatch SSR first failed through a request body stream associated with an earlier Cloudflare request. The generic installed Fetcher adapter creates that stream; installed Effect HttpClientRequest.toWeb preserves the original bytes. The app now uses that native conversion and attached binding fetch. Fresh native mismatches return safe HTML and checked errors. No dependency upgrade or alternate RPC protocol was introduced.','A naive browser-code canary matched PublicCalculatorService.calculate in accepted public documentation prose. The test now positively requires @taxkit/calculators/PublicCalculatorService in the actual API bundle and excludes that executable Context identity from browser output.','TanStack parent-route link activation produced more than one current-page marker; exact link matching restores unique page semantics.','Earlier test locators used a guessed SDK address and an absent authored link. They now select the actual accepted /sdk/typescript-sdk and Plain SDK destinations; no source content was changed.','The first diagram desktop screenshot retained mobile table-focus scroll position. All four supplemental captures now explicitly start at document top.'],\n 'focusedChecks':[json.loads(l) for l in Path('/private/tmp/dev76-website-docs-native-l-results.jsonl').read_text().splitlines()],\n 'fullQualification':{'status':'Pending'},'catalogueIdentity':old['catalogueIdentity'],'preservedSources':old['preservedSources'],'environment':old['environment'],\n 'limitations':['Search interaction, discovery files, Markdown negotiation, share images and retirement of the old documentation app remain unfinished T005 work.','Local built proof establishes no deployed/publicly available page, publication or external consumer.','Metrics remain deferred; disabled collection is retained and safe exported tracing is unfinished.','Controlled failure claims are bounded to the named local tests; no upstream cancellation or all-framework-error-path claim.'],\n 'rollback':'Restore qualified parent 049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e while preserving accepted sources and prior receipts.','task':'CSF-T005 / DEV-76'\n}\nPath(receipt).write_text(json.dumps(r,indent=2)+'\\n')\nPY"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":6458},"formatted_output":""},"started_at_ms":1791302165511,"completed_at_ms":1791302165511}}
