{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T15:57:04.633Z","ordinal":48095,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a111ee-caf9-72e3-95f1-5869f43d1e43","author":"/root/impeccable_finish_reviewer","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/impeccable_finish_reviewer\nPayload:\ndisposition: ship\n\nSaved review: [dev76-website-docs-finish-review.md](/private/tmp/dev76-website-docs-finish-review.md)\n\nInputs: PRODUCT.md, DESIGN.md, approved comp, measured diff and quality card were not supplied; the brief makes these unnecessary for this existing-site extension. The test file was sampled. Review used the supplied degraded review contract, screenshots and source only.\n\n## persistence\n\nPass within scope. The rendering files, styles and browser checks contain the work. All four required captures exist, show the document top, match their named page and width, and show no broken or blank regions. No new visual world or concept roll was required.\n\n## fidelity\n\n| Element or promise | Result | Evidence |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| TYPE | match | Retained Inter/system text, clear headings and monospace for code. |\n| MATERIAL | match | Plain document surfaces, restrained borders and a genuine geometric diagram. |\n| GROUND | match | Pale #f8fafc, dark #172033 and blue article links match the direction. |\n| Purpose | match | Actual document titles, opening copy and instructions lead. |\n| Existing visual system | match | The quiet documentation style is retained. |\n| Reading order | match | Headings, code and next steps follow the authored order. |\n| First viewport | match | Captured phone and desktop views expose the title and useful opening copy. |\n| Page form and navigation | match | A 72ch article, desktop sidebar, native phone disclosure and visible focus follow the brief. |\n| Phone diagram/table | adaptation | Diagram lettering is too small on the phone. The readable table directly below preserves its information; the labelled scroll region provides access to all columns without widening the page. This follows the supplied phone-access evidence. |\n| Truth and scope | match | No invented claims or decorative assets found. This review covers rendering/navigation only; it makes no completion claim for the deferred work. |\n\n## ceiling\n\nReached for the supplied Read-mode extension. Type, spacing, links and keyboard focus support reading. No material craft-floor issue is visible under the retained direction. The parent reports a clear UI hook result; no second detector ran.\n\n## material_fixes\n\nNone.\n\n## keep\n\nKeep the authored content and tax information, quiet reading layout, useful phone table, native navigation controls and clear keyboard focus."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791302224.633357}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1008}}
