{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T16:05:52.349Z","ordinal":48239,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-3ffc1e4a-a46d-498f-a6e6-049f6872935c","process_id":"77977","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","gh pr view 155 --json title,body,baseRefName,headRefName,isDraft,state,url; git remote -v; git branch --show-current"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"gh pr view 155 --json title,body,baseRefName,headRefName,isDraft,state,url; git remote -v; git branch --show-current"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"{\"baseRefName\":\"codex/dev-75-shared-rate-limits\",\"body\":\"The replacement API and website need one checked source for public documentation. This change builds a reviewed catalogue of all 61 pages and serves navigation, page JSON, bounded search and processed Markdown through four HTTP routes and four named native documentation RPC operations. Page JSON and Markdown use the same accepted sources and links.\\n\\nThe API loads only generated JSON. Both transports share the owning content service and its checked public page address and fixed missing-page/search errors. Documentation has a separate closed client and revision 1; all nine calculator methods and revision 4 are preserved. Each client call owns its receive-loop scope, a ten-second complete-response deadline and a 2 MiB byte limit. Malformed native replies become checked failures; unrelated adapter defects keep their identity. Actual fatal and procedure defects retain fixed safe wire messages. The combined RPC server now requires ContentService as well as the calculator service; the major Changeset records that caller change.\\n\\nEvery page has an individual recorded review. Two API reference pages have fresh records for the HTTP routes; all 62 earlier review records are retained. This connection slice preserves every accepted page, navigation, all 64 review records and active bindings, four original integration templates and tax calculation results. HTML and processed Markdown retain matching checked page links and pinned repository links.\\n\\nValidation for `049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e`:\\n\\n- All repository tests pass in 95.83 seconds. Full verification passes in 628.61 seconds, including all 32 actual workflow tests, types, lint, documentation/runbooks, repository paths, both unused-code checks and browser checks.\\n- All 308 RPC tests and 572 actual CLI lint fixtures pass. Controlled native wire cases cover version mismatch, fixed expected errors, malformed/empty replies, unrelated adapter defects, exact/oversized byte limits, stalled headers/body, early cancellation, status rejection and safe fatal/procedure defects.\\n- The actual built local workerd/Chromium pair passes all 11 tests. It compares every accepted page object and exact Markdown through the native documentation client and HTTP, plus navigation/search and retained calculator/browser/no-JavaScript journeys.\\n- An ordinary compiled Node 24 reader independently compares all 61 pages, navigation, Markdown, search and missing-page behaviour. All forty frozen candidate source hashes remain unchanged after complete qualification.\\n- Final supporting metadata checks pass. The [native connection receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-docs-connection.json) retains source/compiled identities, successful checks, rejected experiments and corrections, limitations and rollback. The earlier HTTP slice also qualified the real ten-artifact external package consumer; it has its own [bounded receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/103feda047566d0941dc974784adf38eeaf9d68a/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-06-public-content-http.json).\\n\\nThe HTTP parent `103feda047566d0941dc974784adf38eeaf9d68a` passed [hosted Quality](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37474986158/job/112307948305). Hosted checks for this new connection commit are separate and pending after push.\\n\\nDEV-76 / T005 remains in progress. The replacement website still needs its production documentation client/loader/routes and search, discovery files and share images, with equivalent journeys before retiring apps/docs. Metrics work remains deferred under Cooper's instruction. No merge, deployment, registry publication or provider apply.\\n\",\"headRefName\":\"codex/dev-76-public-content-catalogue\",\"isDraft\":true,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[DEV-76] Build reviewed docs catalogue and checked content connections\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/155\"}\nentire\tentire://aws-ap-southeast-2.entire.io/gh/crcorbett/taxkit (fetch)\nentire\tentire://aws-ap-southeast-2.entire.io/gh/crcorbett/taxkit (push)\norigin\thttps://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit.git (fetch)\norigin\thttps://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit.git (push)\ncodex/dev-76-public-content-catalogue\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"{\"baseRefName\":\"codex/dev-75-shared-rate-limits\",\"body\":\"The replacement API and website need one checked source for public documentation. This change builds a reviewed catalogue of all 61 pages and serves navigation, page JSON, bounded search and processed Markdown through four HTTP routes and four named native documentation RPC operations. Page JSON and Markdown use the same accepted sources and links.\\n\\nThe API loads only generated JSON. Both transports share the owning content service and its checked public page address and fixed missing-page/search errors. Documentation has a separate closed client and revision 1; all nine calculator methods and revision 4 are preserved. Each client call owns its receive-loop scope, a ten-second complete-response deadline and a 2 MiB byte limit. Malformed native replies become checked failures; unrelated adapter defects keep their identity. Actual fatal and procedure defects retain fixed safe wire messages. The combined RPC server now requires ContentService as well as the calculator service; the major Changeset records that caller change.\\n\\nEvery page has an individual recorded review. Two API reference pages have fresh records for the HTTP routes; all 62 earlier review records are retained. This connection slice preserves every accepted page, navigation, all 64 review records and active bindings, four original integration templates and tax calculation results. HTML and processed Markdown retain matching checked page links and pinned repository links.\\n\\nValidation for `049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e`:\\n\\n- All repository tests pass in 95.83 seconds. Full verification passes in 628.61 seconds, including all 32 actual workflow tests, types, lint, documentation/runbooks, repository paths, both unused-code checks and browser checks.\\n- All 308 RPC tests and 572 actual CLI lint fixtures pass. Controlled native wire cases cover version mismatch, fixed expected errors, malformed/empty replies, unrelated adapter defects, exact/oversized byte limits, stalled headers/body, early cancellation, status rejection and safe fatal/procedure defects.\\n- The actual built local workerd/Chromium pair passes all 11 tests. It compares every accepted page object and exact Markdown through the native documentation client and HTTP, plus navigation/search and retained calculator/browser/no-JavaScript journeys.\\n- An ordinary compiled Node 24 reader independently compares all 61 pages, navigation, Markdown, search and missing-page behaviour. All forty frozen candidate source hashes remain unchanged after complete qualification.\\n- Final supporting metadata checks pass. The [native connection receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-docs-connection.json) retains source/compiled identities, successful checks, rejected experiments and corrections, limitations and rollback. The earlier HTTP slice also qualified the real ten-artifact external package consumer; it has its own [bounded receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/103feda047566d0941dc974784adf38eeaf9d68a/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-06-public-content-http.json).\\n\\nThe HTTP parent `103feda047566d0941dc974784adf38eeaf9d68a` passed [hosted Quality](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37474986158/job/112307948305). Hosted checks for this new connection commit are separate and pending after push.\\n\\nDEV-76 / T005 remains in progress. The replacement website still needs its production documentation client/loader/routes and search, discovery files and share images, with equivalent journeys before retiring apps/docs. Metrics work remains deferred under Cooper's instruction. No merge, deployment, registry publication or provider apply.\\n\",\"headRefName\":\"codex/dev-76-public-content-catalogue\",\"isDraft\":true,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[DEV-76] Build reviewed docs catalogue and checked content connections\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/155\"}\nentire\tentire://aws-ap-southeast-2.entire.io/gh/crcorbett/taxkit (fetch)\nentire\tentire://aws-ap-southeast-2.entire.io/gh/crcorbett/taxkit (push)\norigin\thttps://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit.git (fetch)\norigin\thttps://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit.git (push)\ncodex/dev-76-public-content-catalogue\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":858386500},"formatted_output":"{\"baseRefName\":\"codex/dev-75-shared-rate-limits\",\"body\":\"The replacement API and website need one checked source for public documentation. This change builds a reviewed catalogue of all 61 pages and serves navigation, page JSON, bounded search and processed Markdown through four HTTP routes and four named native documentation RPC operations. Page JSON and Markdown use the same accepted sources and links.\\n\\nThe API loads only generated JSON. Both transports share the owning content service and its checked public page address and fixed missing-page/search errors. Documentation has a separate closed client and revision 1; all nine calculator methods and revision 4 are preserved. Each client call owns its receive-loop scope, a ten-second complete-response deadline and a 2 MiB byte limit. Malformed native replies become checked failures; unrelated adapter defects keep their identity. Actual fatal and procedure defects retain fixed safe wire messages. The combined RPC server now requires ContentService as well as the calculator service; the major Changeset records that caller change.\\n\\nEvery page has an individual recorded review. Two API reference pages have fresh records for the HTTP routes; all 62 earlier review records are retained. This connection slice preserves every accepted page, navigation, all 64 review records and active bindings, four original integration templates and tax calculation results. HTML and processed Markdown retain matching checked page links and pinned repository links.\\n\\nValidation for `049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e`:\\n\\n- All repository tests pass in 95.83 seconds. Full verification passes in 628.61 seconds, including all 32 actual workflow tests, types, lint, documentation/runbooks, repository paths, both unused-code checks and browser checks.\\n- All 308 RPC tests and 572 actual CLI lint fixtures pass. Controlled native wire cases cover version mismatch, fixed expected errors, malformed/empty replies, unrelated adapter defects, exact/oversized byte limits, stalled headers/body, early cancellation, status rejection and safe fatal/procedure defects.\\n- The actual built local workerd/Chromium pair passes all 11 tests. It compares every accepted page object and exact Markdown through the native documentation client and HTTP, plus navigation/search and retained calculator/browser/no-JavaScript journeys.\\n- An ordinary compiled Node 24 reader independently compares all 61 pages, navigation, Markdown, search and missing-page behaviour. All forty frozen candidate source hashes remain unchanged after complete qualification.\\n- Final supporting metadata checks pass. The [native connection receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-native-docs-connection.json) retains source/compiled identities, successful checks, rejected experiments and corrections, limitations and rollback. The earlier HTTP slice also qualified the real ten-artifact external package consumer; it has its own [bounded receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/103feda047566d0941dc974784adf38eeaf9d68a/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-06-public-content-http.json).\\n\\nThe HTTP parent `103feda047566d0941dc974784adf38eeaf9d68a` passed [hosted Quality](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37474986158/job/112307948305). Hosted checks for this new connection commit are separate and pending after push.\\n\\nDEV-76 / T005 remains in progress. The replacement website still needs its production documentation client/loader/routes and search, discovery files and share images, with equivalent journeys before retiring apps/docs. Metrics work remains deferred under Cooper's instruction. No merge, deployment, registry publication or provider apply.\\n\",\"headRefName\":\"codex/dev-76-public-content-catalogue\",\"isDraft\":true,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"title\":\"[DEV-76] Build reviewed docs catalogue and checked content connections\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/pull/155\"}\nentire\tentire://aws-ap-southeast-2.entire.io/gh/crcorbett/taxkit (fetch)\nentire\tentire://aws-ap-southeast-2.entire.io/gh/crcorbett/taxkit (push)\norigin\thttps://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit.git (fetch)\norigin\thttps://githu