e standalone browser assertions: the route tree followed the docs route static loader import into Cloudflare and native server-only code. Application getRouter now supplies the named page loader through the existing typed RouterContext pattern beside settings. The page route imports no loader implementation. Focused standalone browser tests pass all20 cases without aliases, mocks of server modules or an extra compiler plugin; native production transport proof remains separate.');r['focusedChecks'].extend(json.loads(l) for l in Path('/private/tmp/dev76-website-docs-focus-d-results.jsonl').read_text().splitlines());r['designDocumentation']['laterCorrectionReview']='Styles, MDX components and rendered composition are unchanged. A later route loader correction uses the typed application router context; no visual system change.';p.write_text(json.dumps(r,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nPY\",max_output_tokens:1000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 /private/tmp/dev75-request-run-checks.py '[[\\\"format\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"format\\\"]],[\\\"knip\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"knip\\\"]],[\\\"knip-production\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"knip:production\\\"]],[\\\"lint\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"lint\\\"]],[\\\"docs\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"check:docs\\\"]],[\\\"runbooks\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"check:runbooks\\\"]],[\\\"worker-types\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"--filter=web\\\",\\\"check:worker-types\\\"]],[\\\"build\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"build\\\"]],[\\\"native\\\",[\\\"bun\\\",\\\"run\\\",\\\"web:test:native-pair\\\"]]]' dev76-website-docs-focus-e\",yield_time_ms:1000,max_output_tokens:1800}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791303935.139089}}}
