{"timestamp":"2026-10-06T16:59:03.741Z","ordinal":48698,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a11227-8abd-7320-b4e7-3dd6f3785fca","call_id":"call_O8O51im7RfJHZSY7EXXHEDDD","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.3 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"7763b5\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000010667,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":37,\"output\":\"To https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit.git\\n   049b04ff..7647642d  codex/dev-76-public-content-catalogue -> codex/dev-76-public-content-catalogue\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"dc8c9f\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000007584,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":11,\"output\":\"7647642d8e87c3b8123c70fac93ee9afe4c2a1a1\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"378149\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000006625,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":923,\"output\":\"The replacement website now renders all 61 reviewed documentation pages through the API's checked catalogue. This PR also builds that catalogue and provides navigation, page JSON, bounded search and processed Markdown through four HTTP routes and four named native documentation RPC operations. Calculators keep their nine operations, revision 4 and retained results; documentation uses a separate client and revision 1.\\n\\nThe website renders actual articles, navigation, metadata, canonical URLs and explicit Markdown links. Internal links preserve normal browser navigation and deliberate heading focus. Phone navigation, keyboard table access and reading without JavaScript work. When the API page and compiled presentation have different content, metadata or module identity, the page shows fixed recovery guidance. The private connection preserves native request bytes across Cloudflare requests and keeps provider diagnostics out of replies.\\n\\nThe API loads generated JSON only. Each documentation RPC call has its own receive-loop scope, a ten-second complete-response deadline and a 2 MiB byte limit. Website native GET functions admit only their generated identities and bounded public page inputs; original page addresses own server rendering. All accepted page, navigation, review and integration-template sources remain unchanged in this website connection slice. The earlier package contract Changeset is retained; these private app consumer changes add no package export or wire contract.\\n\\nValidation for `7647642d8e87c3b8123c70fac93ee9afe4c2a1a1`:\\n\\n- All repository tests pass (83.25 seconds), and complete verification passes (649.13 seconds), including all 32 actual workflow tests, both unused-code checks, types, lint, documentation/runbooks, paths and browser checks. The 591 actual-command lint fixtures preserve exact decoder and renderer restrictions.\\n- The freshly built local workerd/Chromium pair passes all 11 tests. It reads actual HTML for every accepted page and checks native 404, bounded GET admission, cold body/metadata/missing-module failures, malformed real browser transport, links without document reload, focus, phone controls and no-JavaScript reading. Existing HTTP/RPC/calculator journeys remain.\\n- An ordinary compiled Node 24 reader independently checks all 61 pages, navigation, exact Markdown, search and missing-page behaviour. All 40 frozen changed-source/owner hashes and 127 retained source/review hashes are unchanged after complete qualification.\\n- Fresh independent reading review returns **ship**, with no material fixes. A separate design documentation review confirms an ordinary extension of the existing system. Four saved desktop/phone captures supplement functional checks; final built images match their reviewed bytes. A final Effect-services documentation clarification passes the separate metadata checks. The [website connection receipt](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/blob/7647642d8e87c3b8123c70fac93ee9afe4c2a1a1/docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-07-website-docs-connection.json) retains successful and failed attempts, source/compiled identities, reading review and rollback.\\n\\nThe preceding native connection commit `049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e` passed [hosted Quality](https://github.com/crcorbett/taxkit/actions/runs/37481631010/job/112330954103). Hosted checks for this new commit are separate and pending after push.\\n\\nDEV-76 / T005 remains in progress: documentation search UI, discovery files, Markdown negotiation, share images and old-app retirement are unfinished. Metrics stay deferred under Cooper's instruction. No merge, deployment, registry publication or provider apply.\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a110dd-a561-7f92-9e34-cf5bd1e8dee9","create_time":1791305943.741582}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000}}
