tion.md:4026:### T005 checked public-content HTTP candidate — 6 October\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4029:`/api/v1/docs`: navigation, page JSON, bounded search and processed Markdown.\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4035:The actual built native API compares all 61 page objects and Markdown bodies\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4036:with their owning catalogue, plus navigation/search/CORS/invalid-query/missing\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4060:connection/routes, discovery/images and old-app retirement remain T005 work.\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4063:### T005 native documentation connection candidate — 7 October\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4068:bounded public page address and fixed missing-page/search failures to both\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4080:credential, deployment or operational command changes. Website page/search\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4081:composition and discovery remain unfinished; the retained docs app stays until\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4087:all 61 page values and Markdown bodies against the same owning catalogue.\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4099:### T005 Website documentation composition candidate — 7 October\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4114:Compiled Markdown and frontmatter must match the API page at preload and display.\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4116:Canonical links use the checked Website origin; explicit Markdown links use the\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4130:records complete repository qualification separately; whole T005 stays in progress.\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4151:Search UI, crawler/discovery files, Markdown negotiation, share images and\ndocs/exec-plans/active/clean-slate-foundation.md:4152:old-app retirement remain unfinished T00