tation, not a design rule for future pages to copy.\\n\\nThe dated receipt currently still calls full qualification and fresh review\\npending, while its embedded reviewer result says ship. This pre-existing\\nrecord mismatch was reported to the parent agent for the existing closeout\\nwork. It was not repaired by this read-only design pass. No other material\\nvisual drift was found in the sampled source or captures.\\n\\nSearch, discovery files, Markdown negotiation, share images and retirement of\\nthe old documentation app remain unfinished T005 work. Metrics remain\\ndeferred. This report establishes no deployment, public availability,\\npublication, complete repository qualification or external consumer result.\\n\\n```yaml\\ncandidate:\\n  source: The five sampled source files, incumbent HEAD stylesheet, four saved captures and named review/test records listed above.\\n  provenance: Delegated Impeccable documenter read-only comparison.\\n  freshness: Checked on 7 October 2026; source and capture hashes are listed above.\\n  classification: Supporting local design evidence; no system change.\\n  audience: Parent agent and Cooper.\\n  attachedEvidence: The exact source, capture, review and test paths listed above.\\n  proposedSemanticOwner: Existing Website source and frontend/content architecture; no new owner proposed.\\n  targetRevision: Base 049b04ff9b71e8705507e819ba3ea31f8c9fa64e plus the sampled uncommitted source hashes above.\\n  unresolvedContradictions: Existing receipt says qualification/review pending while its embedded reviewer result says ship.\\n  responsibleReviewer: Parent agent for this supporting report; independent finish reviewer for the supplied ship decision.\\n  publisherIdentity: Unknown; no publication is requested or authorised by this pass.\\n  publicationStatus: Not published; isolated temporary report only.\\n  revocationQuarantine: Disregard this report if any sampled source changes; repeat the comparison before reuse.\\n  lastKn